---
title: Polenta Lasagna
description: This Polenta Lasagna is made with layers of firm polenta, a savory spinach mushroom filling, melty cheese, and a roasted red pepper sauce.  If making polenta from scratch, allow 8 hours for refrigeration. Vegetarian and gluten-free. Vegan-adaptable.
